# Keep committed bytes unchanged when cloning or archiving the plugin.
# Anthropic's directory rejects attributes that rewrite file contents.
# Disabling text conversion also keeps LF shell scripts safe on Windows,
# even when a contributor has core.autocrlf enabled.
* -text

# Binary assets: never diff or merge as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
